00:04:27.675 --> 00:04:29.745
That is going to be our product, right?

00:04:29.745 --> 00:04:34.535
So we're making three waters, uh,
part of, as part of our reaction.

00:04:35.115 --> 00:04:39.755
This is going to combine it together
to make our, our, uh, final product

00:04:39.755 --> 00:04:46.195
